{"games":[{"id":12684368460,"name":"Build a bunker to survive zombies tycoon","desc":"🛡️ Welcome to Build a Bunker tycoon! \n\n🧟 The world is overrun by zombies and you are building a bunker to survive. Team up with your friends to help you research the zombies and build the biggest bunker!\n\n💼 Hire researchers to study the zombies  \n💰 Sell research to expand your base  \n🔫 Eliminate zombies for extra money  \n🚗 Use vehicles to deliver research faster!\n\n💻💰Your researchers work offline for you! Make sure to join back to claim your money!\n\n🎮 Play with friends, kill zombies together, and upgrade your base!\n\n⚠️ HOW TO SELL: There are 3 researchers on the map where you can sell research at from your tycoon! Use your vehicle to drive to that location.\n\n💾 Progress autosaves — come back anytime!  \n👍 Like the game to support updates and new content!\n\n🔫 Join our group for a free gun! https://www.roblox.com/groups/16114420 💥\n\nTags: zombie, tycoon, survive, bunker, build to survive, zombies, tycoons, fun, undead, defense, survival, invasion, apocalypse","path":"/game/12684368460-build-a-bunker-to-survive-zombies-tycoon","slug":"12684368460-build-a-bunker-to-survive-zombies-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/9383deda2e7cbe598a4671f2a9a29206003c3131b210126a761b6be83d056d84.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4bc488cf9f0b4a94560d4e623622d2b2/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":88816475,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-29T07:17:56.153Z","creator":{"name":"Fractured Column","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8619263259,"name":"[Valentines + Skins] Critical Legends","desc":"Critical Legends is now officially discontinued. However, the game will not be shutting down.\nI've simply reached a point where I want to move on and focus on other projects and interests. Please don't be angry or disappointed. Sometimes the healthiest decision a creator can make is to move forward when a project no longer brings them fulfillment.\n\nI hope you can understand my decision.\nTo everyone who has played, supported, contributed to, or simply been part of this community:\n\nThank you.\n\nThank you for the memories, the support, and for making Critical Legends what it became.\n\n\n[v4.0.2]\nFull log in our server\n\nEnter the captivating realm of Critical Legends, where epic adventures shape timeless legacies. Traverse forbidden terrain, face exotic foes, and emerge as a legend. Trading within this world is an art—use \"!trade USERNAME\" in Roblox chat, waiting two minutes between trades. All thanks to the visionary Radi Studios, the architects of this wondrous realm!\n\n","path":"/game/8619263259-valentines-skins-critical-legends","slug":"8619263259-valentines-skins-critical-legends","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/3c3302cc95bf1ccd7eb18b3a0dec2b06d8f78410c6e8ac6e8a90e0beaf53c1df.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3af2253d2ebead16ed5c9031e88717b9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":43436704,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-26T14:51:41.798Z","creator":{"name":"Radi Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":9,"freeCount":9,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":6154561555,"name":"Tower of Colors! 🌈","desc":"🌟Welcome to the Tower of Colors! 🌈\n\n😃 Each tower has 8 new and random stages!\n🕒 7 minutes to beat the tower!\n🎉 Use coins to buy round modifiers or a cool new outfit!\n\n✨ Premium Benefits: Exclusive Daily Rewards\n\nTower obby game inspired by Tower of Hell and Tower of Misery ","path":"/game/6154561555-tower-of-colors","slug":"6154561555-tower-of-colors","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/f5015e3d28d615b9d2b540dabc2ea418079e18806eae3e8c0a215bf5be8cb35c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-988ded724cb53bc940af1a3bb383e5e4/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":60778846,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-28T18:29:29.599Z","creator":{"name":"MuPower","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5534891288,"name":"Project: SCP","desc":"Project SCP is a round-based casual (not very competitive) SCP game for all platforms and even supports VR.\nyour objective is to escape the facility either as a D-Class or Researcher\n\n\nKeyboard Controls:\nE | interact\nTab  | Inventory\nLeft Shift  | Run\nLeft Click | Shoot/Attack\nRight Click | Aim\nP   | Disable/Enable GUIs\nM  | Admin Menu (VIP Servers)\nN  | Player list\nF  | Inspect weapon (only work on a few)\n\nBadge Icons by franbos4 & Callio_Saiyan\nOwner - Aaro_1\nScripting - Aaro_1 / anexpia\nBuilding - franbos4 / Citrinities / anexpia\nModeling - franbos4\n\nMusic Composer - astowo\nAmbience Composer - LeFormula / panzerv1\n\nGame Inspired By - SCP : SL\n\nContent relating to the SCP Foundation, including the SCP Foundation logo, is licensed under Creative Commons Sharealike 3.0 and all concepts originate from the scp wiki and its authors.","path":"/game/5534891288-project-scp","slug":"5534891288-project-scp","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/514101c27717bc83d9102fbb00eca975931913c45ad9f49636f4a2dcdb9017bd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a001b5fa1a6247bdfc802ff3510c3286/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":27647946,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-09T12:50:55.120Z","creator":{"name":"Project : SCP","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":12899192156,"name":"Youtuber Empire","desc":"💻 Build your own YouTube Empire!\n\n📹 RECORD VIDEOS for CASH and SUBSCRIBERS!\n💻 UPGRADE your SETUP!\n🖥️ PURCHASE NEW EQUIPMENT!\n🔨 HIRE WORKERS!\n😎 GROW your CHANNEL and BECOME FAMOUS!\n\n🥳 UPDATE AT 25K LIKES!\n\n🔗 Tags: Youtuber, YT, Simulator, Tycoon, Subs, Subscribers, Content Creator, Money, PC.","path":"/game/12899192156-youtuber-empire","slug":"12899192156-youtuber-empire","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/ed6c58d0d52063aaf1333ba2